403 egress denied
destination: %H:%p
control:     identity (the client certificate's subject is not this listener's agent)
policy:      @POLICY_PATH@  (profile "@PROFILE@")
remediation: present the certificate issued for THIS listener's agent, or use that agent's own
             network. A certificate is bound to one agent by its subject and the binding is
             checked here -- a valid certificate from the same CA carrying another agent's
             subject is refused rather than accepted as that other agent (T34)
record:      the mediator's audit line for this attempt is the authoritative denial record, and
             it carries reason=subject_mismatch with identity_source=listener -- no certificate
             was accepted, so the attribution is network-derived and says so
